    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "H3hqZ6",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 100,
      "name": "design notes",
      "width": 360,
      "height": 320,
      "content": "mattstack window · native shell for deck apps\n\n· Lives in mattstack.app (rt-tray), not a new Tauri app: the bundle already owns mattstack:// and ships Sparkle updates\n· Rail is dynamic: deck /api/apps supplies name, url, icon. New apps appear without an app update\n· Active app: accent bar + full-opacity tile. Inactive tiles dimmed to 68%\n· ⌘1..⌘9 switch apps, tooltip shows name + shortcut on hover\n· Webviews: one WKWebView per visited app, all kept warm (v1). Evaluate memory later\n· mattstack://open/<app>/<path> deep-links into an app inside the window\n· Traffic lights inline in the rail: no title bar, content is full-bleed\n· deck tile bottom-left: utility slot, opens the deck board; green badge = deck daemon healthy"
    }
